ChapterTransition(Route21Ch, 7, 2)

ToRoute21EBush:
ChapterTransition(Route21Ch, 11, 1)

ToRoute21WBush:
ChapterTransition(Route21Ch, 6, 1)

ToRoute1:
ChapterTransition(Route1Ch, 13, 39)








