PokedexRatingTextEvent: 
MemSlotToString(s9) 
TEXTSTART 
TEXTSHOW (-1)
TEXTEND 
MemSlotToString(sA) 
TEXTCONT 
TEXTEND 
TEXTCONT 
TEXTEND 
REMA 
ENDA 

RatePokedexEvent:
ASMC CountSeenASMC 
SADD s9 sC s0 
ASMC CountCaughtASMC
SADD sA sC s0 
SVAL s1 150
BGE 0 sA s1 
SVAL s1 140 
BGE 1 sA s1 
SVAL s1 130 
BGE 2 sA s1 
SVAL s1 120 
BGE 3 sA s1 
SVAL s1 110 
BGE 4 sA s1 
SVAL s1 100 
BGE 5 sA s1 
SVAL s1 90 
BGE 6 sA s1 
SVAL s1 80 
BGE 7 sA s1 
SVAL s1 70 
BGE 8 sA s1 
SVAL s1 60 
BGE 9 sA s1 
SVAL s1 50 
BGE 10 sA s1 
SVAL s1 40 
BGE 11 sA s1 
SVAL s1 30 
BGE 12 sA s1 
SVAL s1 20 
BGE 13 sA s1 
SVAL s1 10 
BGE 14 sA s1 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan10

GOTO 20 

LABEL 0 // 150 / Complete dex 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_Complete
GOTO 20 
LABEL 1 // 140 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan150
GOTO 20 
LABEL 2 // 130 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan140
GOTO 20 
LABEL 3 // 120 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan130
GOTO 20 
LABEL 4 // 110 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan120
GOTO 20 
LABEL 5 // 100 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan110
GOTO 20 
LABEL 6 // 90 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan100
GOTO 20 
LABEL 7 // 80 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan90
GOTO 20 
LABEL 8 // 70 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan80
GOTO 20 
LABEL 9 // 60 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan70
GOTO 20 
LABEL 10 // 50 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan60
GOTO 20 
LABEL 11 // 40 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan50
GOTO 20 
LABEL 12 // 30 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan40
GOTO 20 
LABEL 13 // 20 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan30
GOTO 20 
LABEL 14 // 10 
SVAL s2 DexRating_Text_LessThan20
GOTO 20 




LABEL 20 
CALL PokedexRatingTextEvent
GOTO 99 

